# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# The build context is src/ -- docker-compose uses `context: .` from this
# directory, and CI runs `cd src && docker build .`. The Dockerfile does
# `COPY . .`, so anything not excluded here is baked into an image layer
# and ships wherever that image goes. Without this file the live API key
# in .env and the whole .venv would be copied in.
#
# Paths are relative to the context root. Nested matches need **/.

# ── Secrets & local configuration ───────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Negation must come LAST: .dockerignore is last-match-wins, so a broad
# pattern placed after this line would silently re-exclude the template.
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*.json
*credentials*.yaml
*credentials*.yml
*secrets*.json
*secrets*.yaml
*secrets*.yml
.netrc

# ── Virtual environments ────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
**/.venv

# ── Python bytecode & build artifacts ───────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.so
*.egg
*.egg-info
dist/
build/
*.whl

# ── Test, coverage & type-check artifacts ───────────────────────────
# NB: the tests/ sources themselves are deliberately NOT excluded, so
# the suite can still be run inside the container.
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/

# ── VCS & agent tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# These live at the repository root, one level above the context, so
# they cannot be reached today. Kept as a guard in case the context is
# ever widened to the repo root.
.git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.claude/
.factory/
.factory/plans/

# ── IDE / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Not needed at runtime ───────────────────────────────────────────
README.md
docker-compose.yml
.gitlab-ci.yml
.dockerignore
